      "claim_id": "C3",
      "text": "The Energy Generation and Storage segment revenue increased by 26.62% (calculated) from $10,086 million in 2024 to $12,771 million in 2025, driven by increases in PRODUCT_30 and PRODUCT_31 deployments, as detailed in Item 7; the filing reports a rounded increase of 27%.",
